{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん\nひなぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実家、長崎から\nかんころもちが送られてきた川後です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎といえば、\nちゃんぽんやカステラの\nイメージかもしれませんが、\nかんころもちも美味しいです。是非。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いお芋のもちみたいな。おやつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和と若月にもくばった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでくれた～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜は個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました。・°°・(＞_＜)・°°・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しい握手ありがとう～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝！！><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部目:ワンピース×ベレー帽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部目:いずこねこさんパーカー×ツイン\n3部:いずこねこさんパーカー×ねこみみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手後は、\nAKBゆあみと遊びました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみと始めて遊んだわりに\n相当語った気がするよ⁽⁽ଘ( ˊᵕˋ )ଓ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日プレゼントも\n渡せたからよかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊ぼうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、全国握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみと一緒でした！\n仲良しコンビ⁽⁽ଘ( ˊᵕˋ )ଓ⁾⁾嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このコンビ好きといってくれるかたいて嬉しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん\nありがとうございましたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンは、\nメンバーとお家パーティー楽しかった！\nひなは、黒猫の魔女みたいなコスプレしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"血のり使って遊んだり、\nピザ食べたり、\n人狼やったり楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(逆さまにゃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/11/04/1318793/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(Wひな)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。755というアプリ始めてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、\nちゃんとブログのコメント読んでます！！！いつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ755について意見ください。\n755は自由参加のものです。\n賛否両論あるのでファンの方にどうしていったらいいか聞きたいなと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ、モバメ、755をどう使い分けていくのか悩んでるので是非コメントに意見ください。ファンの皆さんの意見重視して考えていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょん"}],"source":"archive"}